# Skillama Application Repositories

The Skillama application spans three separate repositories. Use these absolute paths when working across services or in parallel:

| Service | Path | Role |
|---------|------|------|
| Frontend | `/Users/jitendra_chandwani/Desktop/skillama-lms` | React LMS web application |
| API Backend | `/Users/jitendra_chandwani/Desktop/prwatech` | Main API / backend services |
| AI Tutor Backend | `/Users/jitendra_chandwani/Desktop/ai-tutor` | AI tutor service |

## Parallel Work

When a task touches multiple services, read or edit files in the relevant repos above. Shell commands and file tools can target any of these paths directly.
